Make sure the "include" folder contain the header files for GLFW and GLEW, 
and the "lib" folder contain the .lib files for those libraries.

The dll files for GLFW and GLEW should be in the same directory as the program.

To run the code, change the paths in the commands to point to the "include" and "lib" folder:

- g++ -g -std=c++17 -o "filename".exe -IC:\path\to\cap5705_fproj\include -LC:\path\to\cap5705_fproj\lib "filename".cpp -lglew32 -lglfw3dll -lopengl32
